      "parameters": {
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1000,
        "content": "## Workflow 04R — Durable Source Plan → Composition → Review Render\nDRAFT / inactive / enabled=false. Manual run makes no service calls.\n\nBind the existing private intake host and Header Auth on both HTTP nodes. The server loads its accepted intelligence plan; no caller-supplied plan, asset paths or approval flags are trusted. Configure trusted benchmark assets, local measured guide narration and the opt-in durable render worker first.\n\nQueue inputs and asset bytes are frozen transactionally. Worker leases fence stale attempts; lost deterministic work can retry at most three times in isolated paths. Paid model reservations are not replayed by this worker.\n\nThe result is an authenticated review preview, not a published final. Unsupported components, timing, layout or QC failures stop for review. Polling is bounded at 120 waits; exhausting polls does not cancel or re-enqueue the server job. Read quality/DURABLE_SOURCE_RENDER_SETUP.md. No Telegram, Drive or Sheets writes are included."
      }
    }
